 "text": "Navigation\nSkip to Content\nVoice Search\nSearch\nSkip to main content\n 8976862090\n +91-22-68276827\n Branch Locator\nभाषा\nहिन्दी\nमराठी\nAbout Us\nProducts\nGroup Business\nCustomer Services\nInvestor Relations\nIIO GIFT City\nNRI\nNPS\nPay Premium\nLogin \ngo to top\nHome\nGolden Jubilee Foundation - Community Development\nGolden Jubilee Foundation – Community Development\nInstructions for scholarship applicants:-\nApplications received will be processed in two phases by the relevant Divisional Offices, namely PRELIMINARY AND FINAL.\nApplicants who pass the preliminary assessment will be contacted by the Divisional Offices to provide documents for final evaluation.\nApplicants must submit the requirement to the Divisional Offices within the specified time frame, failure to do so will result in your application not being considered for final evaluation.\nEach Divisional Office will select 80 candidates under General Scholarship and 40 candidates under Special Scholarship.\n \nList of Divisional Offices (Content: English | Format: PDF | View/Download |Size: 463 KB)\n\n\nGolden Jubilee Scholarship Scheme 2026 (Content: English | Format: PDF | View/Download |Size: 601 KB)\n\n\nTO KNOW STATUS OF YOUR APPLICATION, CLICK HERE\n\n\nApplication Status Tracker – User Guide (Content: English | Format: PDF | View/Download |Size: 392 KB)\n\n \n\nLIC Golden Jubilee Foundation was established on 20.10.2006, and registered with Charity Commissioner under Bombay Public Trust Act 1950 with the objective of promoting education, health, relief of poverty or distress and advancement of other objects of general public utility.\n\nTo achieve these objectives, the foundation works with human and capital resources received from LIC.\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nCategory\tNumber (Since Inception)\tAmount sanctioned in Rs.\nADVANCEMENT OF EDUCATION\t419\t83,47,97,826/-\nMEDICAL RELIEF\t446\t1,78,17,57,602/-\nOBJECTS OF GENERAL PUBLIC UTILITY\t197\t64,90,78,453/-\nTotal\t1062\t3,26,56,33,881/-\n\nProjects range from scholarships, health initiatives, rural education programmes and providing infrastructural support in fields of education and health.\n\n \n\nObjectives\nDetails of Projects\nContact Details\nWhat's New\nZonewise Details\nActivities\nGolden Jubilee Scholarship Scheme- 2024 \nGolden Jubilee Foundation Photo Gallery\nAbout Golden Jubilee Foundation\n\nPage Last Update Date : 22/10/2026\nBack to Previous\nPlan NAV\nForeign Units \nLIC Associates & Subsidiaries \n1. Associate Companies\n2. Subsidiaries Companies\nLIC Quick Tips\nThings you must know\nWhy Life Insurance\nWhy Invest\nGo Mobile\nWebsite Last Update Date : 03/08/2026\nContact Us\nAap ki punji aap ka Adhikar\nAnti-Bribery And Anti-Corruption Policy\nAnti Fraud Policy\nCareers\nCitizens Charter\nCopyright Policy\nCustomer Education\nCentral Vigilance Commission\nDownload Forms\nView our Ads\n+91-22-68276827\nEmployees Corner\nEnquiry of Outstanding Claims for the Current Year\nEnvironmental, Social, and Governance\nEqual Opportunity Policy\nFrequently Asked Questions\nFeedback\nGlossary\nGolden Jubilee Foundation - Community Development\nGrievance Redressal\nHelp\n +91-8976862090\nHealth Insurance\nHyperlink Policy\nInternational Operations\nInvestee-AMRIT\nIRDAI Consumer Education\nJoin Our Team\nLIC Act\nList of black-listed agents by IRDAI\nNews\nNRI Centre\n Branch Locator\nPhoto Gallery\nPolicy for protection of interests of policyholders\nPress-Release\nPrivacy Policy\nProperty\nRajbhasha Patrika\nRetired Employees Portal\nRTI Center\nStewardship Policy & Disclosure\n \nSwachh Bharat Campaign\nSwavalamban\nTender –Award\nTenders\nTerms & Conditions\nUnclaimed Amounts of Policyholders\nUnderwriting Philosophy\nWelcome Kit\nLIC Pension Fund Limited\nLIC Cards Services Limited\nLIC Mutual Fund Trustee Private Limited\nLIC Mutual Fund Asset Management Limited\nLIC Housing Finance Limited\nLICHFL Asset Management Company Limited\n\nFor any grievances, email at\nco_complaints[at]licindia[dot]com\n\n\n\nCorporate Office : Life Insurance Corporation of India 'Yogakshema' , Jeevan Bima Marg, P.O. Box No19953, Mumbai – 400 021. IRDAI Reg No- 512\n\nFor any query regarding this website, please contact the Web Information Manager\nSmt. Himali Ashish Manjrekar, Administrative Officer, co_cc[at]licindia[dot]com\n\nContent on this website is published and managed by Life Insurance Corporation of India.\n\nSite Visitors: 247539519\n\nPowered by PECS on Liferay DXP\n\nCopyright © 2025 - All Rights Reserved - Official Website of Life Insurance Corporation of India.\n\nTerm & Conditions\nSitemap\n Privacy policy\nHi! I am Your \nVirtual Assistant LIC MITRA",
 "html": "\n              <section class=\"breadcurmb-container\">\n               <div class=\"contentwidth\">\n                <div class=\"portlet-boundary portlet-boundary_com_liferay_site_navigation_breadcrumb_web_portlet_SiteNavigationBreadcrumbPortlet_  portlet-static portlet-static-end portlet-decorate portlet-breadcrumb \" id=\"p_p_id_com_liferay_site_navigation_breadcrumb_web_portlet_SiteNavigationBreadcrumbPortlet_\"><span id=\"p_com_liferay_site_navigation_breadcrumb_web_portlet_SiteNavigationBreadcrumbPortlet\"></span>\n                 <section class=\"portlet\" id=\"portlet_com_liferay_site_navigation_breadcrumb_web_portlet_SiteNavigationBreadcrumbPortlet\"> \n                  <div class=\"portlet-content\"> \n                   <div class=\"autofit-float autofit-row portlet-header\"> \n                    <div class=\"autofit-col autofit-col-expand\"> \n                     <h2 class=\"portlet-title-text\">Breadcrumb</h2> \n                    </div> \n                    <div class=\"autofit-col autofit-col-end\"> \n                     <div class=\"autofit-section\"> \n                     </div> \n                    </div> \n                   </div> \n                   <div class=\" portlet-content-container\">\n                    <div class=\"portlet-body\">\n                     <nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" id=\"_com_liferay_site_navigation_breadcrumb_web_portlet_SiteNavigationBreadcrumbPortlet_breadcrumbs-defaultScreen\">\n                      <ol class=\"breadcrumb\">\n                       <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a class=\"breadcrumb-link\" href=\"https://licindia.in/web/guest/home\" title=\"Home\"> <span class=\"breadcrumb-text-truncate\">Home</span> </a></li>\n                       <li class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><span class=\"active breadcrumb-text-truncate\" aria-current=\"page\">Golden Jubilee Foundation - Community Development</span></li>\n                      </ol>\n                     </nav>\n                    </div>\n                   </div>\n                  </div> \n                 </section>\n                </div>\n               </div> \n              </section>\n              <section class=\"Internal contentwidth\" id=\"maincontent\">\n               <h1 class=\"internal-header\"></h1> \n               <div>\n                <div tabindex=\"0\">\n                 <h1 class=\"internal-header\">Golden Jubilee Foundation – Community Development</h1>\n                 \n                 <h5>Instructions for scholarship applicants:-</h5>\n                 <ol style=\"list-style:disc;\">\n                  <li>Applications received will be processed in two phases by the relevant Divisional Offices, namely PRELIMINARY AND FINAL.</li>\n                  <li>Applicants who pass the preliminary assessment will be contacted by the Divisional Offices to provide documents for final evaluation.</li>\n                  <li>Applicants must submit the requirement to the Divisional Offices within the specified time frame, failure to do so will result in your application not being considered for final evaluation.</li>\n                  <li>Each Divisional Office will select 80 candidates under General Scholarship and 40 candidates under Special Scholarship.</li><!--<li>Each Divisional Office will select maximum 80 candidates under Regular Scheme &amp; 20 candidates under Special Scholarship for Girls pursuing intermediate (10+2).</li>\n\t<li>For any inquiries regarding your application, please contact the Divisional Office mentioned in your acknowledgement. Please refer the PDF provided below for address and email id of the Divisional Office.</li>-->\n                 </ol> &nbsp; \n                 <ol style=\"list-style:disc;\">\n                  <li><strong><a href=\"/documents/d/guest/list-of-divisional-offices_07102025\" target=\"_blank\">List of Divisional Offices&nbsp;<img alt=\"attached file is in PDF Document Format\" data-widget=\"image\" height=\"16\" src=\"/documents/d/guest/pdf\" width=\"16\">(Content: English | Format: PDF | View/Download |Size: 463 KB) </a></strong></li>\n                  <br><!--<li><strong><a href=\"https://gjss.licindia.in/GJSS/\" target=\"_blank\">APPLY HERE FOR SCHOLARSHIP SCHEME 2026&nbsp;<img alt=\"attached file is in PDF Document Format\" data-widget=\"image\" height=\"16\" src=\"/documents/d/guest/pdf\" width=\"16\" />(Content: English | Format: PDF | View/Download |Size: 463 KB) </a></strong></li>-->\n                  <li><strong><a href=\"/documents/d/guest/golden-jubilee-scholarship-scheme-2026\" target=\"_blank\">Golden Jubilee Scholarship Scheme 2026&nbsp;<img alt=\"attached file is in PDF Document Format\" data-widget=\"image\" height=\"16\" src=\"/documents/d/guest/pdf\" width=\"16\">(Content: English | Format: PDF | View/Download |Size: 601 KB) </a></strong></li>\n                  <br><!--<li><strong><a href=\"/documents/d/guest/instructions-to-candidates-for-online-submission-of-application-1-\" target=\"_blank\">Instructions to candidates for online submission of application&nbsp;<img alt=\"attached file is in PDF Document Format\" data-widget=\"image\" height=\"16\" src=\"/documents/d/guest/pdf\" width=\"16\" />(Content: English | Format: PDF | View/Download |Size: 463 KB) </a></strong></li>-->\n                  <li><strong><a href=\"https://gjss.licindia.in/GJSS/trackStatus.html\" target=\"_blank\">TO KNOW STATUS OF YOUR APPLICATION, CLICK HERE</a></strong></li>\n                  <br>\n                  <li><strong><a href=\"/documents/d/guest/application-status-tracker-user-guide\" target=\"_blank\">Application Status Tracker – User Guide&nbsp;<img alt=\"attached file is in PDF Document Format\" data-widget=\"image\" height=\"16\" src=\"/documents/d/guest/pdf\" width=\"16\">(Content: English | Format: PDF | View/Download |Size: 392 KB) </a></strong></li>\n                 </ol>\n                 <p>&nbsp;</p>\n                 <p>LIC Golden Jubilee Foundation was established on 20.10.2006, and registered with Charity Commissioner under Bombay Public Trust Act 1950 with the objective of promoting education, health, relief of poverty or distress and advancement of other objects of general public utility.<br><br> To achieve these objectives, the foundation works with human and capital resources received from LIC.</p>\n                 <p>&nbsp;</p>\n                 <p>&nbsp;</p>\n                 <p>&nbsp;</p>\n                 <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n                  <table class=\"simple-table\">\n                   <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                     <th style=\"background: #004e8f;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: .95em; border: 1px solid #dee2e6;\" scope=\"col\">Category</th>\n                     <th style=\"background: #004e8f;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: .95em; border: 1px solid #dee2e6;\" scope=\"col\">Number (Since Inception)</th>\n                     <th style=\"background: #004e8f;\n    color: white;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: .95em; border: 1px solid #dee2e6;\" scope=\"col\">Amount sanctioned in Rs.</th>\n                    </tr>\n                   </thead>\n                   <tbody>\n                    <tr>\n                     <td>ADVANCEMENT OF EDUCATION</td>\n                     <td>419</td>\n                     <td>83,47,97,826/-</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                     <td>MEDICAL RELIEF</td>\n                     <td>446</td>\n                     <td>1,78,17,57,602/-</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                     <td>OBJECTS OF GENERAL PUBLIC UTILITY</td>\n                     <td>197</td>\n                     <td>64,90,78,453/-</td>\n                    </tr>\n                    <tr>\n                     <td class=\"down\"><strong>Total</strong></td>\n                     <td>1062</td>\n                     <td>3,26,56,33,881/-</td>\n                    </tr>\n                   </tbody>\n                  </table>\n                 </div>\n                 \n                 <p>Projects range from scholarships, health initiatives, rural education programmes and providing infrastructural support in fields of education and health.</p>\n                 <p>&nbsp;</p>\n                 <div class=\"row\">\n                  <div class=\"column\">\n                   <a href=\"/objectives\" title=\"Objectives\">Objectives</a>\n                   <br><a href=\"/details-of-projects\" title=\"Details of Projects\">Details of Projects</a>\n                   <br><a href=\"/contact-details\" title=\"Contact Details\">Contact Details</a>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"column\">\n                   <a href=\"/what-s-new\" title=\"What's New\">What's New</a>\n                   <br><a href=\"/zonewise-details\" title=\"Zonewise Details\">Zonewise Details</a>\n                   <br><a href=\"/activities\" title=\"Activities\">Activities</a>\n                  </div>\n                  <div class=\"column\">\n                   <a href=\"/documents/d/guest/golden-jubilee-scholarship-scheme-2024\" target=\"_blank\">Golden Jubilee Scholarship Scheme- 2024&nbsp;</a>\n                   <br><!--<a href=\"/golden-jubilee-scholarship-scheme\" title=\"Golden Jubilee Scholarship Scheme\">Golden Jubilee Scholarship Scheme 2022</a><br />--> <a href=\"/golden-jubilee-foundation-photo-gallery\" title=\"Golden Jubilee Foundation Photo Gallery\">Golden Jubilee Foundation Photo Gallery</a>\n                   <br><a href=\"/about-golden-jubilee-foundation\" title=\"About Golden Jubilee Foundation\">About Golden Jubilee Foundation</a>\n                  </div>\n                 </div>\n                </div>\n                <div style=\"text-align: right; font-size:20px;\" class=\"updatedate\">\n                 <br><strong>Page Last Update Date : </strong><strong><span id=\"date-output\">22/10/2026</span></strong>\n                 <input type=\"hidden\" id=\"date-input\" value=\"Thu, 22 Oct 2026 06:51:11 +0000\">\n                </div>\n                 \n               </div>\n              <button id=\"bTp\" class=\"back-btn\" type=\"button\">Back to Previous</button></section>\n             ",
